{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他渐渐觉得对方也需要自己，两个人在一起能获得安心，也开始期待彼此陪伴。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欣喜、安心、期待、隐约紧张。\",\n      \"missed\": \"他具体盼望以后对方需要陪伴时会想到自己，以及自己也能一直陪在身边；身体渴望、关系回想中的遗憾与快感混杂；右侧四个情绪阶段和时间流逝的意味。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他开始相信自己对对方也有意义，不只是对方愿意陪他，对方或许也需要他的陪伴。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"高兴、被需要的满足、安心、期待中带着不安。\",\n      \"missed\": \"互相依靠背后的具体期待，尤其是希望未来对方主动想到自己、自己也能一直陪伴对方；中间青色文字描述的身体感受、欲望和复杂回忆，需要逐句读才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他逐渐相信两个人可能是相互需要的，也希望这份陪伴能够持续下去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欣喜、安心、依恋、期待、些许不安。\",\n      \"missed\": \"他从回想一段关系到被身体欲望和复杂情绪卷入的过程，以及这一刻虽然美好却无法停留的时间感；右侧小字的情绪发展顺序也不容易一眼读到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"上下两块大号粗体长句同时争夺第一视觉焦点，而且每块内部都包含好几层意思。虽然两块实际讲的是同一件事：他从感受到对方愿意陪伴自己，逐渐相信彼此需要，并希望继续陪伴，但需要在长句中寻找关键词才能把过程和感受串起来。中间两段青色文字字号较小、信息密度较高，右侧四条情绪阶段也比较边缘化，一眼很难同时抓到身体上的不安、关系中的回想和对彼此依靠的期待。整体不是内容彼此无关，而是主线能抓到，情绪的前因和细节不容易同时抓到。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5f42253a-623d-4070-8fb0-0182f5e174a2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223436801049Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:35:51.555998+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4bb13ccac96ba8c9e5aca3f00acb1889f5910ca8349edcd15137a96f3f270b49", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223436801049Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c07bd03c70489bc47e8c5dc93584aff946d43cdb95e7b87926ae2929b29dec74"}}}
